{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50740","headline":"酬余姚郑摸（《大典》作「模」）明府见赠长句四韵 · 张祜","name":"酬余姚郑摸（《大典》作「模」）明府见赠长句四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（按此诗亦见《永乐大典》卷一一○○○「六姥」「府」字「明府」条。\n〖十一函一百十册〗）仙令东来值胜游，人间稀遇一扁舟。\n万重山色军江徼，十里溪声到县楼。\n吏隐不妨彭泽远，公才多谢武城优。\n生疎莫笑沧浪叟，白首直竿是直鈎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}